1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,890
Birds can eat chilies

2
00:00:00,890 --> 00:00:01,650
that would make you cry

3
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:03,410
and feel nothing

4
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:04,950
The burn isn't real heat

5
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:05,930
It's capsaicin

6
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:06,750
tricking the sensor

7
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:07,670
that warns you about

8
00:00:07,670 --> 00:00:08,770
burns

9
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:09,590
Birds have it too

10
00:00:09,590 --> 00:00:10,830
but capsaicin can't

11
00:00:10,830 --> 00:00:11,890
trick theirs

12
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:12,390
And that helps the

13
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:13,230
pepper

14
00:00:13,230 --> 00:00:14,850
The burn scares off mice

15
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:15,510
which chew seeds

16
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:16,810
to bits

17
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:17,490
Birds swallow them whole

18
00:00:17,490 --> 00:00:19,010
and poop them out

19
00:00:19,010 --> 00:00:20,080
ready to grow

